  outcome is deals closed above brand deal threshold
  direction is more than
  state is desired
  satisfied when is deals more than brand deal threshold
end
end

note ── Dimensional scoring: waiting chain across waiting axis ──

evaluate fair payment and audience reach and brand deals against waiting chain across fractal waiting axis into waiting report
show waiting report

