note ── What this tells you ──
note
note Waiting path:
note   Tier 1 (surface): payment is 0, reach is 3000 — chain is blocked
note   Tier 2 (system):  slippery slope detected on 6-link linear chain → ×0.75
note   Tier 3 (root):    2-tier fractal, D±13 only → ×0.90
note   Gradient: BLOCKED — the chain can't surface the desire at any tier
note
note Leverage path:
note   Tier 1 (surface): payment is 620 vs 500 (✓), reach is 18500 vs 10000 (✓)
note   Tier 2 (system):  slippery slope on 6-link chain → ×0.75
note   Tier 3 (root):    D±39 positive torus → ×1.20 (sovereign signal amplified)
note                     D-39 negative torus → ×0.60 (but capped at 100)
note   Gradient: depends on exact tier scores — surface viable or root stronger
note
note The model doesn't just tell you the gap.
note It tells you which tier of reality is holding you back.
note And precisely what to address at each tier.
